To build and run:
1. Change into the corresponding directory
2. Do "source run.sh" to format the Disk
3a. In flat/, use "source run_ostests.sh" to test the full file system driver (Q4).
            Use "source run_filecheck.sh" to test the file-based APIs.
3b. In any pattern directory, still use "source run.sh" to format the Disk.
        use "source run_<pattern1/pattern2/pattern3/dyn-pattern>.sh" to run the cache tests.
